Now it is evening.
I am alone in my new flat.
It is very quiet here.
I am a little tired.
I am thinking about Mexico.
I miss my family.
It is warm in Mexico now.
Here in Denmark it is cold.
But I am also happy.
I am happy with my flat.
Copenhagen is a new city for me.
I am curious.
I will see more tomorrow.
Tomorrow is a new day.
